{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>下月4至6日於中環海濱舉行的年度國際戶外音樂盛事《Clockenflap音樂節》公布完整表演陣容，周日壓軸嘉賓由地下走上主流的美國樂隊Turnstile擔任，他們今年剛獲頒2項格林美音樂獎，憑《Birds》奪得最佳金屬搖滾歌曲，與憑《Never Enough》奪得最佳搖滾大碟。另外，台灣女歌手陳綺貞相隔10年再度回歸《Clockenflap音樂節》，於周六表演。至於本地方面，則將有清新系女歌手黃妍、J-Rock樂隊晚安莉莉、與Post-Punk樂隊南洋派對N.Y.P.D.等現身，風格多元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.809412+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:49:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:57:51.286146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:09.084482+00:00","content_hash":"ae5862f1c95cff79dc5dc6300a525e58385236f9b4b4e642d7c7974a5b053120","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.809412+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}